{
  "title": "Lean Ground Beef and Quinoa Power Bowls",
  "description": "These Ground Beef and Quinoa Power Bowls deliver 34g of protein and are ready in just 30 minutes. Savory lean beef, fluffy quinoa, and black beans make this a satisfying and efficient meal for your weekly prep.",
  "cuisine": "American",
